.alert.alert-light.border
  %h3.fw-semibold.mb-2 Goal of this page
  %p.mb-3
    Give everyone one place to see what still needs cleaning so MAAPs stay accurate — seat, position, and related alignment work without hunting through individual profiles.

  %h3.fw-semibold.mb-2 Context
  = render "shared/maap/definition"
  %p.mb-3
    This Beta inbox is org-wide. More cleanup sections can land here over time; start with seat ↔ position mismatches that used to be blocked by validation.

  %h3.fw-semibold.mb-2 Specifics of this page
  %ul.mb-2
    %li
      %strong Seat ↔ Position Alignment
      — active employment tenures whose seat does not include the position's title (primary or associated titles).
  %p.mb-0
    Use
    %em Show
    /
    %em Hide
    on each sub-section to open item rows.
    %em Tenure
    opens the employment tenure;
    %em Seat
    opens the seat so you can fix either side.
